luded only when username and password are both supplied.&lt;br&gt;No assessments, audit collection or masking jobs are declared." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n20"><mxGeometry x="250.00" y="70.00" width="910.00" height="135.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No resources. This folder declares an optional IAM policy, budget/alert and Data Safe database target registration.&lt;br&gt;It creates no Core foundation, network, Vault, scanning service or application. Budget values are source input defaults, not estimated or actual spend.&lt;br&gt;The Healthcare / PCI title does not establish regulatory compliance; registration does not prove database security or assessment coverage." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1100.00" width="2460.00" height="135.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" value="Source review: 2026-10-28. No cloud provisioning, provider revalidation, compliance certification, packet test or recovery drill.&lt;br&gt;Placement values are source defaults or marked operator inputs. Arrows are configuration relationships / stated route intent, not verified runtime behavior." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1270.00" width="2460.00" height="65.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily